== Description ==

'''Rebar''' is a crafted component in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Anvil]]. It appears as an ingredient in 22 downstream recipes at the [[Cutting Workbench]] and the [[Mechanical Workbench]], including [[Reinforced Concrete]], [[Electric Motor Engine]], [[Wheel]], [[MechPlatform]], [[Driver's Seat]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

